request.description:
This endpoint returns a subscription token which can be directly used to generate the X-F1-Cookie-Data key that authenticates requests.

**Note:** You must first generate a reese84 cookie and pass it as a header before using this login method.

The X-F1-Cookie-Data key can be generated as follows:
```js
Buffer.from(        // Base64 encode
encodeURIComponent( // Encode%20URI
    JSON.stringify( // Stringify JSON object
        { data: 
            { subscriptionToken: 'token.received.from.request...' }
        }
    )
).toString('base64')
```

